f_name":"lines","leaf_name_norm":"lines","json_type":"object","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":1,"enum_values":null,"description":"A group of business terms providing information on individual Invoice lines.\n\nID: `BG-25`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].id","leaf_name":"id","leaf_name_norm":"id","json_type":"integer","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"A unique identifier for this InvoiceLine across all the system. Only shown if the query parameter \"include\" is \"detailed_lines\".","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].position","leaf_name":"position","leaf_name_norm":"position","json_type":"integer","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"position","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].quantity","leaf_name":"quantity","leaf_name_norm":"quantity","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":true,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Invoiced quantity. The quantity of items (goods or services) that is charged in the Invoice line.\n\nID: `BT-129`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].price","leaf_name":"price","leaf_name_norm":"price","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Item net price. The price of an item, exclusive of VAT, after subtracting item price discount.\n\nThis is the price for `base_quantity` units. When `base_quantity` is 1 (the default), this is the price per single unit. When `base_quantity` is greater than 1, this represents the price for that many units (e.g., 12.50 per 100 pieces).\n\nID: `BT-146`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].base_quantity","leaf_name":"base_quantity","leaf_name_norm":"basequantity","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Item price base quantity. The number of item units to which the price applies.\n\nUsed when the price is quoted per multiple units rather than per single unit (e.g., price per 100 pieces, per 1000 sheets). The line amount is calculated as:\n\n`total_cost = quantity * price / base_quantity`\n\nFor example, 500 screws at 12.50 per 100: `500 * 12.50 / 100 = 62.50`\n\nID: `BT-149`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].description","leaf_name":"description","leaf_name_norm":"description","json_type":"string","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Item Name.\n\nID: `BT-153`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].total_cost","leaf_name":"total_cost","leaf_name_norm":"totalcost","json_type":"number","format":"float","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Line base amount: `quantity * price / base_quantity`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].extension_amount","leaf_name":"extension_amount","leaf_name_norm":"extensionamount","json_type":"number","format":"float","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Line net total amount (total_cost + charges - discounts)\n\nID: `BT-131`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].unit","leaf_name":"unit","leaf_name_norm":"unit","json_type":"unknown","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Invoice line unit of measure. The format depends on the account's\n`unit_code_format`:\n * `internal` (default) — B2BRouter integer unit id (listed below)\n * `unece_rec20` — UN/ECE Recommendation 20 code, e.g. `HUR`, `KGM`\n\nInternal unit ids:\n* `1` - units\n* `2` - hours\n* `3` - kilograms\n* `4` - liters\n* `5`  - other\n* `6`  - days\n* `7`  - boxes\n* `8`  - trays\n* `9`  - barrels\n* `10` - bags\n* `11` - carboys\n* `12` - bottles\n* `15` - centiliters\n* `16` - centimeters\n* `17` - bins\n* `18` - dozens\n* `19` - cases\n* `21` - grams\n* `22` - kilometers\n* `23` - cans\n* `24` - bunches\n* `25` - meters\n* `26` - milimeters\n* `28` - packages\n* `30` - rolls\n* `31` - envelopes\n* `32` - tubs\n* `33` - cubicmeter\n* `34` - second\n* `35` - watt\n* `36` - squaremetre\n* `37` - tonnes\n* `38` - megawatt-hours\n* `39` - months\n* `40` - years\n* `41` - one (synonym of \"units\")","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes","leaf_name":"allowance_charges_attributes","leaf_name_norm":"allowancechargesattributes","json_type":"array","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Line-level allowances (discounts) and charges.\n\nSupports multiple allowances and charges for this invoice line.\n\nLine-level allowances cannot have their own tax configuration.\n\nID: `BG-27`, `BG-28`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[]","leaf_name":"allowance_charges_attributes","leaf_name_norm":"allowancechargesattributes","json_type":"object","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Base schema for allowance charges containing common fields","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].id","leaf_name":"id","leaf_name_norm":"id","json_type":"integer","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"A unique internal identifier of the AllowanceCharge in B2Brouter. It can be used to update or destroy an existing AllowanceCharge.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].allowance_charge_indicator","leaf_name":"allowance_charge_indicator","leaf_name_norm":"allowancechargeindicator","json_type":"string","format":null,"is_required":true,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":["allowance","charge"],"description":"Indicates whether this is an allowance (discount) or charge.\n\nID: `BT-20`, `BT-21` for document level or `BT-140`, `BT-141` for line level","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].amount","leaf_name":"amount","leaf_name_norm":"amount","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The amount of the allowance or charge, without VAT.\nEither amount or percentage must be provided, but not both.\n\nID: `BT-92`, `BT-99` for document level or `BT-136`, `BT-141` for line level","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].percentage","leaf_name":"percentage","leaf_name_norm":"percentage","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The percentage that may be used to calculate the allowance or charge amount.\nEither amount or percentage must be provided, but not both.\n\nID: `BT-94`, `BT-101` for document level or `BT-138`, `BT-144` for line level","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].description","leaf_name":"description","leaf_name_norm":"description","json_type":"string","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The reason for the allowance or charge, expressed as text.\n\nID: `BT-97`, `BT-104` for document level or `BT-139`, `BT-145` for line level","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].is_reimbursable_expense","leaf_name":"is_reimbursable_expense","leaf_name_norm":"isreimbursableexpense","json_type":"boolean","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"[FacturaE Only]\n\nIndicates whether the charge is a reimbursable expense (Spanish \"suplidos\").\nOnly applicable to charges, not allowances.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].base_amount","leaf_name":"base_amount","leaf_name_norm":"baseamount","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The base amount used to calculate percentage-based allowances or charges.\nThis is calculated automatically from the adjustable record.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].calculated_amount","leaf_name":"calculated_amount","leaf_name_norm":"calculatedamount","json_type":"number","format":"decimal","is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The final calculated amount of the allowance or charge.\nFor fixed amounts, this equals the amount field.\nFor percentages, this is calculated from percentage and base_amount.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[].currency","leaf_name":"currency","leaf_name_norm":"currency","json_type":"string","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"The currency of the allowance or charge amounts.\nInherited from the associated invoice.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges_attributes[]._destroy","leaf_name":"_destroy","leaf_name_norm":"destroy","json_type":"boolean","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"Set to true to delete this allowance or charge when updating.\nUsed in nested attribute updates.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges","leaf_name":"allowance_charges","leaf_name_norm":"allowancecharges","json_type":"array","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Line-level allowances (discounts) and charges.\nOnly shown if the query parameter \"include\" contains \"allowance_charges\".\n\nLine-level allowances cannot have their own tax configuration.\n\nID: `BG-27`, `BG-28`","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges[]","leaf_name":"allowance_charges","leaf_name_norm":"allowancecharges","json_type":"object","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":2,"enum_values":null,"description":"Base schema for allowance charges containing common fields","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges[].id","leaf_name":"id","leaf_name_norm":"id","json_type":"integer","format":null,"is_required":false,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":null,"description":"A unique internal identifier of the AllowanceCharge in B2Brouter. It can be used to update or destroy an existing AllowanceCharge.","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges[].allowance_charge_indicator","leaf_name":"allowance_charge_indicator","leaf_name_norm":"allowancechargeindicator","json_type":"string","format":null,"is_required":true,"is_array_item":true,"depth":3,"enum_values":["allowance","charge"],"description":"Indicates whether this is an allowance (discount) or charge.\n\nID: `BT-20`, `BT-21` for document level or `BT-140`, `BT-141` for line level","schema_id":"3e41daf9-174c-4d00-be76-0eee2456bfe5"},{"path":"invoice.lines[].allowance_charges[].amount","leaf_name":"amount","leaf_name_norm":"amount","json_type":"number","format":"decimal